---
kind: keepn
ext: .keepn
version: 1
mime: application/x-keepn
binary: false
trigger: keepn keep record new file type
---

## Purpose

Append-only text keep for project notes and Access-style archives.

## Structure

1. First line is the magic banner `# keepn v1`
2. Optional YAML frontmatter between `---` fences
3. Body is one record per line in `KEY: value` form
4. Blank lines are allowed. Comments start with `#` after the banner.

## Parse rules

- Reject the file if line 1 is not `# keepn v1`
- Split each non-comment body line on the first `: `
- Keys are case-sensitive
- Duplicate keys append; do not overwrite
- Ignore time words if they appear (do not parse clocks)

## Write rules

- Always start with `# keepn v1`
- Append only; never rewrite prior records in place
- One `KEY: value` per line
- No time words in values

## Example

See examples/sample.keepn
